{"articleNo":"80245","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=80245&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013년도 서울시 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.03.21","hit":"5015","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 신명 견고딕; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 견고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 신명 견고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013년도 서울시 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 신명 견고딕; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 견고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 신명 견고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 신명 견고딕; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 견고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 신명 견고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서울특별시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">는 「서울지역 대학생」들에게 학자금 대출 이자를 지원함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">을</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 알려드리니 다음과 같이 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서울지역대학생이란 서울에 주소를 두고 서울소재 대학교에 재학 또는 휴학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">중이거나, 서울소재 고교를 졸업하고 타 지역 대학에 재학 또는 휴학 중인 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">1.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 사 업 명 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서울시 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원(든든장학금 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지원대상 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">한국장학재단에 대출 신청일 현재 기초생활수습권자와</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 소득 10분위 중 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">하위</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1분위부터 7분위에 해당되는 서울특별시민 또는 그 자녀( “서울지역 대학생”)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문(신명조10)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 3. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지원범위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">일반상환 학자금 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">소득 7분위(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대출당시)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 이하 계층 본인 부담 이자액</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 지원액 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">기초,1~3분위 전액, 4~5분위 개인부담액의 90%, 6~7분위&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;개인 부담액의 70%(단 정부지원이 있을 경우 정부지원 포함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문(신명조10)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">다만 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">다자녀(3인 이상) 가구 둘째부터는 소득수준과 상관없이 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">신청시 50%지원</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청조건 : 서울소재 고교졸업자로 타 지역대학에 재학 또는 휴학 중인 학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;및 다자녀가구 둘째부터인 서울지역 대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서울에 주소를 두고 서울소재 대학교에 재학 또는 휴학 중인 대학생과</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>2012년 신청자는 별도신청 없이 재학여부 등 확인 후 일괄지원</u></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 신청기간 : ‘13. 4. 1, 09:00(월) ~ '13. 5. 29, 18:00(수) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 접 수 처 : 서울시 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr//webeditor/pages/www.seoul.go.kr\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">www.seoul.go.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 대상자 확정 및 입금 : ‘13 . 7. 15일 이후 예정임</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘13. 7. 15일 이후 개인별 한국장학재단 학자금대출 이자상환계좌로 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">8. 이자지원 방법 : 대학생 개인별 상환계좌 입금(한국장학재단)</span></p></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
